    "chapters": [
      {
        "id": 17163,
        "title": "Operator kesetaraan",
        "type": "practiceLevel1",
        "lessons": [
          {
            "title": "Lesson #1",
            "id": 145228,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Kita sudah mempelajari cara membuat dan menyimpan nilai, tetapi bagaimana cara membandingkannya?</p><p>Dalam game, kita membandingkan angka dalam situasi seperti memeriksa apakah skor pemain cocok dengan skor yang diperlukan untuk membuka level berikutnya.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" playerScore = \" /><text value=\"1200\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" scoreToUnlock = \" /><text value=\"1500\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /></content></code></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #2",
            "id": 145229,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Untuk membandingkan apakah dua angka sama, kita menggunakan <strong>operator kesetaraan</strong>, <code>===</code>.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"2\" endIndex=\"3\" /><option startIndex=\"3\" endIndex=\"4\" /><option startIndex=\"4\" endIndex=\"5\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"5 === 5\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu memilih <code>=</code>, diikuti oleh <code>=</code>, dan terakhir <code>=</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #3",
            "id": 145230,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Saat membandingkan, hanya ada dua hasil: <code>true</code> atau <code>false</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #4",
            "id": 145231,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Jika kita membandingkan angka yang sama dengan operator kesamaan, hasilnya adalah <code>true</code>.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"12\" endIndex=\"13\" /><option startIndex=\"14\" endIndex=\"17\" /><option startIndex=\"18\" endIndex=\"19\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"3\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\" === \" /><text value=\"3\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\");\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu memilih <code>3</code>, diikuti oleh <code>===</code>, dan terakhir <code>3</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #5",
            "id": 145232,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Saat kita membandingkan dua angka yang berbeda dengan operator equality, hasilnya adalah <code>false</code>.</p><p>Pilih opsi yang membandingkan <code>9</code> dengan <code>10</code>.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"9 = 10\" /></content></option><option startIndex=\"12\" endIndex=\"20\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"9\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\" === \" /><text value=\"10\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\");\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu memilih <code>9 === 10</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #6",
            "id": 145233,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Apa yang kita gunakan untuk memeriksa apakah dua angka sama?</p><selection multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>===</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>=</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu memilih <code>===</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #7",
            "id": 145234,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Apa yang ditampilkan kode ini di konsol?</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><content><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"10\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\" === \" /><text value=\"11\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\");\" /></content></code><selection multiple=\"multiple\"><item correct=\"true\" value=\"1\"><code>false</code></item><item correct=\"false\" value=\"2\"><code>true</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu memilih <code>false</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #8",
            "id": 145235,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Dalam situasi mana kita perlu memeriksa apakah dua angka sama?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Saat memeriksa apakah health pemain <em>tepat</em> 0 (game over)</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Saat memeriksa apakah health pemain <em>kurang dari atau sama dengan</em> 20 (peringatan health rendah)</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Saat memeriksa apakah health pemain <em>tepat</em> 0 (game over).</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #9",
            "id": 145236,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Apa yang ditampilkan kode ini di konsol?</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><content><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"5\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\" + \" /><text value=\"13\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"5\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\" === \" /><text value=\"13\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\");\" /></content></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>18</code> lalu <code>false</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>18</code> lalu <code>513</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\"><code>18</code> lalu <code>false</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #10",
            "id": 145237,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Periksa apakah nilai <code>coins</code> sama dengan <code>11</code>.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"36\" endIndex=\"37\" /><option startIndex=\"37\" endIndex=\"38\" /><option startIndex=\"38\" endIndex=\"39\" /><option startIndex=\"40\" endIndex=\"42\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" coins = \" /><text value=\"10\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(coins === \" /><text value=\"11\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\");\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu memilih <code>=</code>, diikuti oleh <code>=</code>, lalu <code>=</code>, <code>11</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #11",
            "id": 145238,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Tambahkan operator perbandingan kesamaan.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"=\" /></content></option><option startIndex=\"15\" endIndex=\"18\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"99\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\" === \" /><text value=\"100\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\")\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu memilih <code>===</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #12",
            "id": 145239,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Tampilkan <code>false</code> di console.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"10\" /></content></option><option startIndex=\"19\" endIndex=\"21\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"10\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\" === \" /><text value=\"13\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\")\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu memilih <code>13</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #13",
            "id": 145240,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Periksa apakah angka-angka ini sama dengan mengetikkan <code>===</code>.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"validatedInput\" startIndex=\"16\" endIndex=\"19\" isDefault=\"true\" /></interactions><content><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"100\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\" === \" /><text value=\"100\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\");}\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu mengetik <code>===</code>.</p></body></html>"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": 17164,
        "title": "Operator ketidaksamaan",
        "type": "practiceLevel1",
        "lessons": [
          {
            "title": "Lesson #1",
            "id": 145241,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Untuk memeriksa apakah sebuah nilai dalam game tidak sama dengan nilai lainnya, kita menggunakan <strong>operator ketidaksamaan</strong>, <code>!==</code>.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"===\" /></content></option><option startIndex=\"14\" endIndex=\"17\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"1\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\" !== \" /><text value=\"10\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\");\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu memilih <code>!==</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #2",
            "id": 145242,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Kita dapat menyimpan hasil perbandingan dengan operator ketidaksamaan dalam sebuah variabel.</p><p>Simpan perbandingan antara <code>playerLives</code> dan <code>maxLives</code> ke dalam variabel <code>result</code>.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"56\" endIndex=\"57\" /><option startIndex=\"70\" endIndex=\"73\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" playerLives = \" /><text value=\"1\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" maxLives = \" /><text value=\"2\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" result = playerLives !== maxLives;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(result);\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu memilih <code>=</code>, diikuti oleh <code>!==</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #3",
            "id": 145243,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Variabel juga dapat menyimpan hasil perbandingan kesamaan.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"60\" endIndex=\"61\" /><option startIndex=\"75\" endIndex=\"78\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" currentState = \" /><text value=\"1\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" pausedState = \" /><text value=\"2\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" result = currentState === pausedState;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(result);\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu memilih <code>=</code>, diikuti oleh <code>===</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #4",
            "id": 145244,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Kita bisa membandingkan nilai dengan variabel dan variabel dengan variabel lainnya.</p><p>Ketik <code>===</code> untuk membandingkan isi variabel.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"validatedInput\" startIndex=\"70\" endIndex=\"73\" isDefault=\"true\" /></interactions><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" playerScore = \" /><text value=\"1\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" targetScore = \" /><text value=\"2\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(playerScore === targetScore);\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(playerScore !== targetScore);}\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu mengetik <code>===</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #5",
            "id": 145245,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Nilai berapa yang harus dimiliki <code>playerHealth</code> agar perbandingan dalam variabel <code>isFullHealth</code> menghasilkan <code>false</code>?</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" playerHealth = ? ;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" isFullHealth = playerHealth === \" /><text value=\"100\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /></content></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>78</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>100</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu memilih <code>78</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #6",
            "id": 145246,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Apa yang ditampilkan kode ini di konsol?</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" result = \" /><text value=\"7\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\" !== \" /><text value=\"10\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(result);\" /></content></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>true</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>false</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu memilih <code>true</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #7",
            "id": 145247,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Nilai apa yang harus kita berikan kepada variabel <code>coins</code> untuk menyimpan <code>true</code> di <code>hasMaxCoins</code>?</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" coins = ? ; \" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" hasMaxCoins = coins === \" /><text value=\"1000\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /></content></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>1000</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>67</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu memilih <code>1000</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #8",
            "id": 145248,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Berapa nilai <code>playerScore</code> jika kita ingin <code>equal</code> bernilai <code>true</code>?</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" playerScore = ? ;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" highScore = \" /><text value=\"80\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" equal = playerScore === highScore;\" /></content></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>80</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>true</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu memilih <code>80</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #9",
            "id": 145249,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Tambahkan operator yang membuat perbandingan menjadi <code>false</code>.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"===\" /></content></option><option startIndex=\"15\" endIndex=\"18\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"10\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\" !== \" /><text value=\"10\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\");\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu memilih <code>!==</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #10",
            "id": 145250,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Periksa apakah <code>ammo</code> pemain sama dengan <code>13</code> dan simpan hasilnya dalam variabel <code>correctAmmo</code>.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"correctAnswer\" /></content></option><option startIndex=\"35\" endIndex=\"36\" /><option startIndex=\"42\" endIndex=\"45\" /><option startIndex=\"46\" endIndex=\"48\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" ammo = \" /><text value=\"16\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" correctAmmo = ammo === \" /><text value=\"13\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(correctAmmo);\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu memilih <code>=</code>, diikuti oleh <code>===</code>, dan terakhir <code>13</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #11",
            "id": 145251,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Periksa apakah <code>level</code> pemain saat ini sama dengan <code>bossLevel</code> dengan mengetikkan <code>===</code>.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"validatedInput\" startIndex=\"57\" endIndex=\"60\" isDefault=\"true\" /></interactions><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" level = \" /><text value=\"5\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" bossLevel = \" /><text value=\"50\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(level === bossLevel);}\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu mengetik <code>===</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #12",
            "id": 145252,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Periksa apakah nama pemain tidak kosong dengan mengetikkan <code>!==</code>.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"validatedInput\" startIndex=\"52\" endIndex=\"55\" isDefault=\"true\" /></interactions><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" nameLength = \" /><text value=\"12\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" validName = nameLength !== \" /><text value=\"0\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";}\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu mengetik <code>!==</code>.</p></body></html>"
          }
        ]
      }
    ]
  }
}